		(uuid "490449bc-5720-4d42-9e00-2a877afa5c0d")
	)
	(text "Single-sided board for CNC milling: all copper on the top, J1 socket on the bottom.\nJ1 uses only pin 1 (3V3), pin 3 (GPIO2, I2C1 SDA), pin 5 (GPIO3, I2C1 SCL), pins 14 and 34 (GND).\nEvery other header pin is a bare hole with no copper.\nJ2 returns through pin 14 and J3 through pin 34 (GND_PIN34); the Pi joins its GND pins internally,\nwhich a single copper layer cannot do without a jumper. The Pi has 1.8k pull-ups on SDA/SCL."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 50.8 149.86 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
		)
		(uuid "79d9f9dd-f473-4783-9e62-ace74f0b708e")
	)
